      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been having this happen a lot and already voted on it, but I've also been running into the issue where if somebody gets offline, the social menu will never update that they're offline (even if they've been offline for hours) until I completely restart, which may be related so I figured I'd mention it in this thread.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-11T17:52:47.242Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When someone leaves the instance you will be unable to request on them. It will only show the option to join and it will send you to the same instance they left. \nExample: I create a invite+ instance and a bunch of people join. One person leaves and I want to request on them, it will only show me greyed out join and invite options until I restart the game. If I leave the world and then try to join on them it will send me back to the instance I made instead of the one the person is at. \nThis was an issue during the beta and is now affecting the live branch.",
